usage: sol do files.share --path <string> --people <string>... [--mode read|write] [--json] [--dry-run] [--person ID]

Share a folder with people.

Arguments:
  --path    string          required
  --people  list of string  required; repeat the flag or give a comma list
  --mode    string          one of: read, write

Effect:   write (changes data; --dry-run shows what it would do)
Approval: never
